Experimental GPTK 4 beta 3 callback layout repair.
Applies only to Switchyard revision 34a09170d3754522dc55416617c6754dd2d9a086.
Beta 3 has 71 Windows callbacks plus two metadata entries. The three added
callbacks each take one argument block. The native thread callback is slot 43.
The source-built repair passed isolated DXGI factory, adapter and D3D12 device
creation. This patch is not enabled by any Nucleon runtime recipe.

--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -3829,9 +3829,9 @@
 }
 
 #define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_DISPATCH_LEGACY_ENTRIES 43
-#define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_DISPATCH_V4_ENTRIES 70
+#define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_DISPATCH_V4_ENTRIES 73
 #define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_CALLBACK_LEGACY_ENTRIES 41
-#define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_CALLBACK_V4_ENTRIES 68
+#define SWITCHYARD_GPTK_WIN32_CALLBACK_V4_ENTRIES 71
 
